<PageTitle>Security - P1 Inventory</PageTitle><section class="public-page-head"><span class="eyebrow">SECURITY</span><h1>Security designed into every inventory workflow.</h1><p>Identity, tenant isolation, role-based authorization, audit history and secure integrations are first-class architecture concerns.</p></section><section class="feature-matrix"><article><h2>Tenant isolation</h2><p>Every tenant-owned resource is scoped server-side.</p></article><article><h2>Role-based access</h2><p>Granular permissions with warehouse resource scopes.</p></article><article><h2>Auditability</h2><p>Security and business actions have traceable audit events.</p></article><article><h2>Strong authentication</h2><p>MFA-ready sign-in and secure session controls.</p></article></section>
